  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de8943d9067711bf708d68/step-70650055.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook remaining garlic until fragrant, 1 min. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Add fetta to garlic oil mixture, and stir to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de8943d9067711bf708d68/step-a45117cf.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook chickpeas, tomato and carrot, until slightly golden and tender, 4-6 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add tomato paste and garlic seasoning and cook, until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the water (for the sauce) and remaining butter and simmer, until slightly thickened, 2-4 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de8943d9067711bf708d68/step-63fd8cc9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir baby spinach through garlic rice.\n• Divide spinach rice and tomato chickpeas between bowls.\n• Serve with garlic-fetta. Top with flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de8943d9067711bf708d68/step-d6f37b9e.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
